readsb (3.16.22) stable; urgency=medium

  * bugfix: Fix rtl_tcp ECONNRESET on connect — replace non-blocking connect+select+fcntl
    with simple blocking connect using SO_SNDTIMEO for timeout (P0 regression)
  * bugfix: Fix mutex deadlock in rtltcp_do_connect — removed redundant sdrControlMutex
    lock inside function because sdrOpen() already holds it
  * bugfix: Fix mutex deadlock in rtlsdrSetGain for rtl_tcp mode — same redundant lock
  * validation: 5-minute rtl_tcp streaming test passed (144M samples/min, 34K preambles/min,
    4.5% CPU, 0 samples dropped, 0 crashes, 0 watchdog trips)
  * validation: Full strace analysis confirmed TCP connect, dongle info recv, and
    MSG_WAITALL data streaming all behave correctly
  * build: All code compiles with -Werror, zero warnings

